# doc/

Generated Rustdoc HTML documentation for the secrets_rs crate, containing rendered documentation pages, navigation metadata, and styling assets. Automatically produced during the documentation build process.

## Dirs

- `static.files/` -- CSS stylesheets, fonts, and JavaScript bundles for the documentation UI

## Files

- `crates.js` -- Registry of documented crates
- `src-files.js` -- Source file navigation structure  
- `help.html` -- Rustdoc help page
- `settings.html` -- Rustdoc settings page
- `.lock` -- Build artifact lock file
